            {
              "content": "=You are a professional HR Manager.\n\nWrite a warm and professional job application acceptance email.\n\nCandidate Name:\n{{$('Webhook').item.json.body.candidateName}}\n\nPosition:\n{{$('Webhook').item.json.body.position}}\n\nScore:\n{{ JSON.parse($('Resume Analysis').item.json.output[0].content[0].text).score }}\n\nSummary:\n{{ JSON.parse($('Resume Analysis').item.json.output[0].content[0].text).summary }}\n\nInstructions:\n- Congratulate the candidate.\n- Inform them they have successfully passed the initial screening.\n- Mention that their qualifications impressed the recruitment team.\n- Inform them that they will soon receive details regarding the technical interview.\n- Maintain a professional and encouraging tone.\n- End with:\n\nBest Regards,\nHR Team\n\nReturn ONLY the email body."
            }
          ]
        },
